---
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
// GitHub, September 2012 split of the MySQL cluster. Facts from the post text.
---
<figure class="rf">
  <div class="rf-scroll">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 900 440" role="img" aria-label="On Tuesday the cluster split: nodes a and b on one side, node c, known to be out of date, on the other. Node c elected itself at 8:19 AM and was powered off at 8:26 AM, taking github.com down. In those seven minutes it handed out MySQL IDs that no longer matched Redis, so some events showed on wrong dashboards and 16 private repositories were reachable by outsiders.">
    <rect x="20" y="20" width="360" height="130" rx="4" class="box" />
    <text x="200" y="44" text-anchor="middle" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>Side one</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Bên thứ nhất</tspan></text>
    <rect x="50" y="58" width="130" height="76" rx="4" class="box" />
    <DiagramIcon name="mysql" x={115} y={86} size={30} />
    <text x="115" y="124" text-anchor="middle" class="t-b"><tspan data-lang-en>node a</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>node a</tspan></text>
    <rect x="210" y="58" width="130" height="76" rx="4" class="box" />
    <DiagramIcon name="mysql" x={275} y={86} size={30} />
    <text x="275" y="124" text-anchor="middle" class="t-b"><tspan data-lang-en>node b</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>node b</tspan></text>
    <rect x="540" y="20" width="340" height="130" rx="4" class="box bad" />
    <text x="710" y="44" text-anchor="middle" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>Side two</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Bên thứ hai</tspan></text>
    <rect x="600" y="58" width="220" height="76" rx="4" class="box bad" />
    <DiagramIcon name="mysql" x={632} y={86} size={30} />
    <text x="722" y="82" text-anchor="middle" class="t-h"><tspan data-lang-en>node c</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>node c</tspan></text>
    <text x="722" y="100" text-anchor="middle" class="t-bad"><tspan data-lang-en>out of date</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>dữ liệu cũ</tspan></text>
    <text x="722" y="120" text-anchor="middle" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>elects itself, 8:19 AM</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>tự bầu mình, 8:19 sáng</tspan></text>
    <line x1="382" y1="89" x2="538" y2="89" class="edge bad" />
    <DiagramIcon name="fail" x={460} y={89} size={26} />
    <text x="460" y="66" text-anchor="middle" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>cluster split</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>cluster bị chia đôi</tspan></text>
    <text x="460" y="128" text-anchor="middle" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>Pacemaker segfault</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Pacemaker segfault</tspan></text>
    <line x1="100" y1="214" x2="800" y2="214" class="edge " />
    <circle cx="100" cy="214" r="7" class="box bad" />
    <circle cx="800" cy="214" r="7" class="box bad" />
    <text x="100" y="190" text-anchor="middle" class="t-bad"><tspan data-lang-en>8:19 AM</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>8:19 sáng</tspan></text>
    <text x="800" y="190" text-anchor="middle" class="t-bad"><tspan data-lang-en>8:26 AM</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>8:26 sáng</tspan></text>
    <text x="100" y="242" text-anchor="middle" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>c elects itself</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>c tự bầu mình</tspan></text>
    <text x="800" y="242" text-anchor="middle" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>c powered off:</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>tắt nguồn c:</tspan></text>
    <text x="800" y="258" text-anchor="middle" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>github.com down</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>github.com sập</tspan></text>
    <text x="450" y="204" text-anchor="middle" class="t-b"><tspan data-lang-en>7 minutes: c takes writes and hands out MySQL IDs</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>7 phút: c nhận lệnh ghi và cấp ID MySQL</tspan></text>
    <DiagramIcon name="mysql" x={130} y={330} size={30} />
    <text x="130" y="362" text-anchor="middle" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>IDs made on c</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>ID sinh ra ở c</tspan></text>
    <line x1="160.0" y1="330.0" x2="291.0" y2="330.0" class="edge bad" /><polygon points="300.0,330.0 291.0,325.5 291.0,334.5" class="head bad" />
    <text x="230" y="316" text-anchor="middle" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>no longer match</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>không còn khớp</tspan></text>
    <DiagramIcon name="redis" x={330} y={330} size={30} />
    <text x="330" y="362" text-anchor="middle" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>Redis lookups</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>tra cứu Redis</tspan></text>
    <rect x="480" y="290" width="400" height="130" rx="4" class="box bad" />
    <text x="496" y="316" class="t-bad"><tspan data-lang-en>What went wrong, for those 7 minutes</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Điều đã hỏng trong 7 phút đó</tspan></text>
    <text x="496" y="340" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>some events showed on the wrong</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>vài sự kiện hiện trên dashboard</tspan></text>
    <text x="496" y="358" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>users' dashboards</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>của sai người dùng</tspan></text>
    <text x="496" y="380" class="t-bad"><tspan data-lang-en>16 private repositories were reachable</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>16 repository private bị người ngoài</tspan></text>
    <text x="496" y="400" class="t-bad"><tspan data-lang-en>by outsiders</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>truy cập được</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Seven minutes with a stale node in charge. The damage was not only lost data: IDs from the stale node no longer pointed at the right things in Redis.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Bảy phút với một node cũ làm chủ. Thiệt hại không chỉ là mất dữ liệu: ID từ node cũ không còn trỏ đúng thứ cần trỏ trong Redis.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .rf { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .rf-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .rf svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .rf text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .rf .t-h { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .rf .t-hs { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .rf .t-b { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .rf .t-note { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .rf .t-mono { font-size: 12px; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace; fill: var(--text); }
  .rf .t-bad { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; font-size: 13px; }
  .rf .t-ok { fill: var(--text); font-weight: 700; font-size: 13px; }
  .rf .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .rf .box.strong { stroke: var(--text); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .rf .box.bad { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .rf .box.ok { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .rf .box.empty { fill: none; stroke-dasharray: 4 3; }
  .rf .box.bad.empty { fill: none; }
  .rf .edge { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; fill: none; }
  .rf .edge.dash { stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .rf .edge.bad { stroke: var(--red); stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .rf .edge.ok { stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .rf .head { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .rf .head.bad { fill: var(--red); }
  .rf .head.ok { fill: var(--gold-icon); }
  .rf figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
